{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the skies across shifting dimensions!</strong><br><br><strong>MPPP \u2013 Multidimensional Paper Plane Project</strong> is a simple yet challenging game where you try to survive as long as possible in an ever-changing world. Each world in different dimension introduces new mechanics, keeping you on your toes.<br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect coins</strong> and <strong>complete feats</strong> to increase your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive through <strong>ever-changing dimensions</strong>, shifting every few seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore <strong>7 unique dimensions</strong>, each with its own mechanics inspired by classic and popular mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a <strong>secret 8th dimension</strong>\u2014only the luckiest players will find it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete for the highest score on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711410?t=1749517787","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711410?t=1749517787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711410/e02249fc8754245f5a8101571ce714092bce5f15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749517787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711410/e02249fc8754245f5a8101571ce714092bce5f15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749517787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3778510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the skies across shifting dimensions!</strong><br><